Release 0.2.1.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 20:10:01

Fixed. development/tools/install-requirements.sh, run without an option, says before each question what the group
installs and which tests use each tool (stress-ng, lm_sensors, vkmark, nvme-cli, fio, memtest_vulkan, vkpeak, the
Ookla speedtest CLI, sqlite). The manual points at Console Helpers where it gives the steps by hand: the optional
tools, MangoHud's FPS log, the IOMMU (test 23, whose row now says to leave the IOMMU off by default and to turn it
off again when it is on and the system is unstable), the CPU mitigations (test 24), vm.max_map_count (test 37) and
the journal kept on the disk (test 34). Test 23's description in the app and its line in the log say the same: by
default leave the IOMMU off, and if it is on and the system is unstable, turn it off again.

